  <graph edgedefault="undirected">
    <node id="&quot;WORKSOP TOWN F.C.&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Worksop Town F.C. is a local football club founded in 1861, located in Worksop, England, known for its historical significance and recent contributions from players like Grant Brown."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0174</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;GRANT BROWN&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Grant Brown is a football player born in 1969, known for his contributions to Worksop Town F.C., particularly in the 1990-1991 season and beyond."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0174</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;RETFORD&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Retford is a nearby town where Grant Brown grew up, known for its connection to Grant's early life and passion for football."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0174</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;GAINSBOROUGH TRINITY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Gainsborough Trinity is a local football club that played against Worksop Town F.C. in the 1990-1991 season."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0174</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;MARK CARTER&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Mark Carter is a former teammate of Grant Brown at Worksop Town F.C., known for playing alongside Brown in the backline during the 1990-1991 season."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0174</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;STEVE LUDLAM&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Steve Ludlam is the manager of Worksop Town F.C. during the 1993-1994 season, known for his praise of Grant Brown's performance."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0174</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;BUXTON F.C.&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Buxton F.C. is a football club that Worksop Town F.C. faced in a 2-1 win in April 1994, where Grant Brown scored a crucial goal."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0174</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;WORKSOP GUARDIAN&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Worksop Guardian is a local newspaper that published an article praising Grant Brown's performance in a 2-1 win over Buxton F.C. in April 1994."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0174</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;FC SMOLEVICHI&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"FC Smolevichi is a football club based in Smolevichi, Belarus, where Grant Brown plays and feels a sense of belonging and commitment."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0174</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;VIKTOR KUZNETSOV&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Viktor Kuznetsov is the manager of FC Smolevichi, known for his approval of Grant Brown's performance and his belief in Brown's leadership potential."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0174</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SERGEI&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Sergei is a young Belarusian winger who catches Grant's eye during the training session."&lt;SEP&gt;"Sergei is a young Belarusian winger who is a teammate of Grant Brown at FC Smolevichi."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0174</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SMOLEVICHI&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Smolevichi is a Belarusian town where FC Smolevichi is located, known for its passionate fan base and the setting of Grant Brown's current career."&lt;SEP&gt;"Smolevichi is a town in Belarus where FC Smolevichi is located, known for its passionate fan base and the setting of Grant Brown's current career."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0174</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;DINAMO MINSK&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Dinamo Minsk is a football club that FC Smolevichi faced in a match where Grant Brown performed well, impressing Viktor Kuznetsov."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0174</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;WORKSOP&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Worksop is a town in Nottinghamshire, England, where Worksop Town F.C. is located and where Grant Brown grew up."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0174</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;NOTTINGHAMSHIRE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Nottinghamshire is a county in England where Worksop is located, known for its historical significance and the presence of Worksop Town F.C."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0174</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;EAST MIDLANDS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"East Midlands is a region in England where Worksop is located, known for its industrial landscape and the presence of Worksop Town F.C."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0174</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;NORTHERN PREMIER LEAGUE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Northern Premier League is a football league where Worksop Town F.C. competed, known for its competitive nature and the rise of Grant Brown."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0174</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;PREMIER DIVISION&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Premier Division is a division within the Northern Premier League where Worksop Town F.C. was promoted in the 1993-1994 season."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0174</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SANDY LANE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Sandy Lane is the stadium where Worksop Town F.C. plays, known for its significance in the team's history and Grant Brown's fan favorite status."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0174</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;BELARUS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Belarus is a country where FC Smolevichi is located, known for its rich football culture and the setting of Grant Brown's current career."&lt;SEP&gt;"Belarus is the origin of Sergei, indicating his nationality and background."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0174</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;BELARUSIAN&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Belarusian refers to the cultural and linguistic identity of the people in Belarus, which Grant Brown embraces as part of his new team."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0174</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SOVIET-ERA PHILOSOPHERS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
