    <node id="&quot;CHILDREN'S LAUGHTER&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Children's laughter is mentioned as part of the peaceful evening in Smolevichi, adding to the description of the setting."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0174</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;TRAINING SESSION&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Training Session is an intense event where Grant and the team are pushed to their limits by Viktor."&lt;SEP&gt;"Training session is the intense workout session Grant Brown participates in at FC Smolevichi, showcasing his dedication and commitment."</data>
